ile_name": "vlcsnap-2025-08-28-16h54m10s543.png", "id": "787783233690659", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828806_787783237023992_610498081522419934_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rZQdL3_kFbkQ7kNvwGGcSHN&_nc_oc=AdmNt2zzjiD88dmp7snU0p0KRh694Wd-dKr9L-UzVk6xdeE3l_uT-1Dec-PXTuKqJSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv0bHGegURqT6GdWG8YQ4J6Q_iJXnYocSA96LquWEFPIA&oe=69A58A62"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zombie Hunter VR - Pixel Survival", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Step into the danger zone as a commando and become the ultimate Zombie Hunter. Survive endless waves, achieve the highest kill count, and prove your survival time on the leaderboard.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Gameplay Video 1 \u2013 Zombie Hunter Waves\nAs a fearless Zombie Hunter, face relentless pixel zombies charging from all directions. Aim sharp, shoot fast, and survive.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Gameplay Video 2 \u2013 Survival Hunter Mode\nEndure the chaos and show your Zombie Hunter skills. The longer you last, the higher your score climbs on the board.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Gameplay Video 3 \u2013 Pixel Hunter Action\nDive into retro-inspired pixel visuals as a true Zombie Hunter, with immersive VR shooting mechanics for nonstop action.", "short_description": "Be the ultimate Zombie Hunter in VR! Survive pixel zombie waves, rack up kills, and fight for the longest survival time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "6443548731067